# Written by: bash tools/render-deps.sh --print-pins <package>
#
# The render stack (Dawn + libuam) as one verified downloadable package, so that a
# recipient does not spend hours compiling it. An empty URL means nothing has been
# hosted yet; the engine then builds the stack itself, as before. Put an https
# address here as soon as the file is somewhere public (GitHub release, object
# storage, your own server).
#
# sha256 is the guarantee: a package installs only if it matches byte for byte.
# The name and size ride along so the app can state them before it starts.
